## P6-1 assertion band

| ID | Assert |
| -- | ------ |
| OTP-01 | Phone → OTP step after request-otp |
| OTP-02 | Dev code `1234` verifies in test/dev |
| OTP-03 | New user → profile step before intake |
| OTP-04 | Existing user → skips profile |
| OTP-05 | Profile rejects empty name |
| OTP-06 | Profile allows empty email |
| OTP-07 | Success marker after intake |

